# Shell scripts must always check out with LF line endings, even on
# Windows with core.autocrlf enabled -- a CRLF-mangled shebang or CRLF
# inside a bash script's control structures can break execution, which
# would be a real problem specifically for orchestration/run_dagster_dev.sh
# (a fix for a Windows-specific issue) on the exact platform it targets.
*.sh text eol=lf
data/raw/Payments[[:space:]]Data[[:space:]]Atlas.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
